Package: SenateData
Type: Package
Title: A Functional Tool for 'SenateData'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ben", "Yoel", email = "benjaminyoel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Iliya", "Liampert", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: A tool that imports, subsets, and cites the 'SenateData' dataset. 'SenateData' contains over 1,100 variables concerning all U.S. senators and their states with data back to 1789. The dataset tracks state characteristics, senators, and the political behavior of those senators. Users with only a basic understanding of R can subset this data across multiple dimensions, look up what each variable measures, and get the plain-text or BibTeX citations for the variables they use.
